// A compact source file (JEP 512) whose main takes `String[] args`. The
// parameter-taking form used to stay an instance method, and codegen's entry
// point then emitted a value cast for the receiver, so the program did not
// build at all. `main` is a static member of the implicit class, like every
// other member of a compact source file.
//
// The .args file next to this program passes three words, so the count is not 0.
void main(String[] args) {
  System.out.println("args length: " + args.length)
  System.out.println("first: " + args[0])
}
